<h1>New Round Slot</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">This command is accessible from</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Datuming &gt; Round Slot</b></span><span class="Path">,</span> by using the shortcut <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Shift + Alt + 9</b></span> <span class="Shortcut">or by choosing the</span> <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Round Slot tab</b></span> <span class="Shortcut">in the</span> <span class="Shortcut" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Datum creation</u></span> <span class="Shortcut">mode (if it is currently active).</span></p>
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description</b></span>: New Round Slot command creates new datum round slot by the interactive method only. Here below this method is explained followed by example.</p>
<h2><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Method</span></i></b></span></h2>
<p class="sub-head"><i style="font-style:normal;"><span lang="EN-US">Interactive</span></i></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span class="Command"><img src="Images/new_roundslot_interactive.gif" width="32px" height="29px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Command" lang="EN-US">: standard round slot construction using one of the available 4</span></i> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Command" lang="EN-US">definition</span></i> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Command" lang="EN-US">methods (pick from viewport is enabled by default). For more details about the define section, see <a href="../Working_with_Data/Descriptions/define_round_slot.htm" style="font-weight:bold;">Define Round Slot</a>.</span></i></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Command" lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></i></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP234809955" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Examples/InteractiveRoundSlot.gif" width="622px" height="601px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="whs6"><span class="Command" style="font-style:normal;">Changes of all values can be applied at any time. Flip the axis direction of the final datum using the "<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>+/-</b></span>" button in the result section, if necessary.</span></p>
